WEBVTT

01:19.470 --> 01:21.110
You pigs aren't in shape!

01:21.110 --> 01:24.770
Watch with a heart that's like a mirror without a single flaw or a perfectly still pool of water!

01:52.580 --> 01:54.710
Everyone, quiet down.

01:56.930 --> 02:00.940
This is Midarezaki Yuuka-chan,
who will be studying with you all starting today.

02:01.260 --> 02:03.680
Here, write your name on the board.

02:16.960 --> 02:17.990
What's wrong?

02:16.960 --> 02:18.800
Hey, she's kinda weird.

02:29.880 --> 02:31.680
Maybe you're a little too nervous.

02:31.680 --> 02:33.250
Go and take your seat.

02:37.210 --> 02:39.540
Ah, my bad, my bad.

02:39.540 --> 02:40.650
Are you all right?

02:42.450 --> 02:46.430
Now, open your textbook to page seventeen.

02:49.270 --> 02:50.510
It's always like this.

02:50.860 --> 02:53.520
Why do I always mess up?

02:56.390 --> 02:58.300
You're annoying.

03:10.910 --> 03:13.250
Let's have a wedding!

03:15.210 --> 03:22.470
I hear when people get married, they hold astounding parties where brides get to dress up and get fawning attention.

03:22.470 --> 03:25.970
Why did you hide such exciting information from me?

03:25.970 --> 03:32.190
Although we're married, it is out of necessity for the job, so we don't have to do something embarrassing like that, do we?

03:26.530 --> 03:31.270
Ah, an astounding party. Must feel so good.

03:32.190 --> 03:35.180
This, this, and this.

03:35.940 --> 03:38.940
I get it. This is a decided matter, isn't it?

03:35.940 --> 03:38.940
Look at Kyouka-sama's beauty.

03:38.940 --> 03:41.780
You don't care about your husband's opinion at all.

03:41.780 --> 03:44.130
You're the equivalent of this plastic grass!

03:44.130 --> 03:47.370
The main character is me, Kyouka-sama, analogous to the supreme sushi.

03:47.370 --> 03:50.010
Oh my gosh, what a nice dress.

03:47.370 --> 03:49.190
You're less than a side!

03:49.190 --> 03:51.450
Sides don't get any rights!

03:50.010 --> 03:54.130
Being born a girl allows one to enjoy this kind of happiness.

03:54.130 --> 03:56.840
Oh yeah, songs come with weddings, don't they	?

03:56.840 --> 04:02.070
Teika-chan, Hyouka-chan. Let us really dress up and sing a song as a present.

04:02.460 --> 04:04.710
We'll be the Frenzy Sisters.

04:04.710 --> 04:08.080
Oh my, I'm already getting excited.

04:04.710 --> 04:06.610
I'm a male...

04:06.610 --> 04:07.640
What a pain.

04:08.080 --> 04:09.950
See, everyone is against the idea.

04:09.950 --> 04:11.120
I'm not against it at all.

04:11.120 --> 04:14.560
This is an important event to strengthen the family's bond!

04:14.560 --> 04:19.210
We must tighten the bond and make
the Children of Enka that are within us think,

04:19.210 --> 04:24.120
"The family is so nice. If the world's like this,
I might just forget about revenge."

04:24.120 --> 04:27.980
This is the most fitting event for Operation Cozy Family.

04:27.980 --> 04:30.220
You just want to have some fun, right?

04:42.480 --> 04:43.700
I'm back.

04:43.700 --> 04:44.930
Welcome home, Yuuka.

04:45.400 --> 04:47.510
Wow, Mom, you're so cute.

04:47.510 --> 04:48.560
What's going on?

04:48.920 --> 04:53.450
We are going to have a gorgeous wedding for Kyouka-sama herself!

04:53.450 --> 04:55.640
Yuuka, I've tailored a dress for you, too.

04:55.640 --> 04:56.100
Really?

04:56.520 --> 05:01.530
Something that's cute that will work as a catalyst to make my beauty stand out.

05:01.530 --> 05:03.850
Pick anything you want.

05:02.320 --> 05:05.480
Wow, they're all so cute, I simply can't choose.

05:05.550 --> 05:07.230
I think I'll go with this.

05:07.230 --> 05:08.630
What do you think, Dad?

05:08.630 --> 05:09.930
It looks great on you.

05:11.830 --> 05:14.250
Wh-What was that for?

05:14.250 --> 05:16.550
Don't look at Yuuka with such lecherous eyes!

05:16.550 --> 05:18.320
They were the eyes of a father!

05:18.320 --> 05:20.910
I don't want you imagining strange things!

05:27.160 --> 05:28.160
Honored Sister.

05:29.690 --> 05:31.520
What is it, Teika-kun?

05:31.520 --> 05:33.900
I detected a faint scent of blood.

05:35.010 --> 05:36.980
You did? I don't know what you're talking about.

05:36.980 --> 05:38.530
You're hurt, aren't you?

05:42.190 --> 05:46.020
I think it's best you get Father or Honored Brother to treat it.

05:46.020 --> 05:47.740
I-It's not serious.

05:53.790 --> 05:58.740
Honored Sister. Could it be that something bad is happening at school?

05:58.740 --> 06:01.180
Maybe it's best you talked with Father.

06:01.180 --> 06:05.340
Everyone looks so excited over the wedding, so I don't want to ruin it with my story.

06:06.840 --> 06:08.340
I'm simply fine.

06:08.340 --> 06:10.040
Please, don't tell them about this.

06:40.360 --> 06:42.160
I'm off!

06:47.870 --> 06:48.880
Here is the cake.

06:49.470 --> 06:54.100
I must pick a cake fitting for my wedding!

06:54.100 --> 06:54.810
Sushi!

06:54.810 --> 06:55.740
Here they are!

06:55.740 --> 06:57.430
I don't recall ordering this.

07:01.360 --> 07:02.260
Fine.

07:02.830 --> 07:05.920
But taking a bite from all of this might give me an upset stomach.

07:05.920 --> 07:07.260
I need someone to do it instead.

07:07.260 --> 07:09.790
Hey, the wedding cakes are here!

07:09.790 --> 07:12.670
I thought I'd let you have a taste, too.

07:12.670 --> 07:14.370
I'm not hungry right now.

07:15.230 --> 07:17.730
Also, please knock before you come in.

07:17.730 --> 07:19.440
We're married! Why be so formal?!

07:21.500 --> 07:23.540
You've finally come to ignoring me.

07:23.540 --> 07:26.550
I thought I would say something funny and make you laugh.

07:26.550 --> 07:28.490
I won't eat even if you try to get me in a good mood.

07:28.490 --> 07:30.170
Plus, nothing was funny.

07:31.050 --> 07:35.350
You don't have any intention of making your wedding with Kyouka-sama herself a fabulous event?!

07:35.350 --> 07:37.510
I'll tattle on you for neglecting your work!

07:37.510 --> 07:41.750
Compared to going around and taste testing wedding cakes,

07:41.750 --> 07:46.440
I think getting to know the children well as their father is being more faithful to what my work is.

07:46.440 --> 07:47.770
What did you say?

07:48.880 --> 07:50.990
Yuuka's a Himemiya?

07:51.360 --> 07:52.940
What's the matter with that?

07:52.940 --> 07:57.090
The Himemiya are one of the greatest asset holders in Japan.

07:57.090 --> 08:01.500
However, the Himemiya are not famous for being great asset holders, but rather, how they make the money.

08:01.500 --> 08:02.740
Huh?

08:03.370 --> 08:09.840
They back all sorts of crimes, wars, and massacres to make great profit through them.

08:09.840 --> 08:11.800
They are the "House of Oni".

08:11.800 --> 08:13.700
They're a family stained in blood.

08:15.200 --> 08:19.200
How could such a kind girl as her have lived in the House of Oni?

08:19.660 --> 08:20.960
I can't imagine it.

08:21.350 --> 08:22.370
You're too sweet.

08:22.850 --> 08:27.570
You're so sweet that you should be coated with cream and be made the wedding cake!

08:27.570 --> 08:28.360
What is this?

08:29.110 --> 08:30.870
Midarezaki Ginka. 23 years old.

08:30.870 --> 08:32.130
Real name: Kizakura Ginichi.

08:32.130 --> 08:34.440
His father is a third-generation yakuza boss.

08:34.440 --> 08:36.840
He's been told to live like a man from when he was young,

08:36.840 --> 08:40.660
and because of that, started to show symptoms of GID soon after graduating from high school.

08:43.810 --> 08:45.270
Midarezaki Teika. 7 years old.

08:45.270 --> 08:46.300
Real name: Shakuya.

08:46.300 --> 08:50.740
Born in the grasslands at the westernmost extent of the Great Japanese Empire, known as the "savanna".

08:50.740 --> 08:55.510
Raised as the next ruler of the Bister Kings and demonstrated the influence Bister Kings have from the time he was a child.

08:55.510 --> 08:58.840
But due to conflict amongst their own kind, the great majority of them have died.

08:59.730 --> 09:01.300
Midarezaki Hyouka. 3 years old.

09:01.300 --> 09:02.790
Real name: Black Thirteen.

09:02.790 --> 09:10.980
A biological weapon created by Dr. Gebok, the Artificial Life Form R&D Third Lab chief researcher, thirteen years ago.

09:10.980 --> 09:12.730
Made from Enka's flesh.

09:12.730 --> 09:16.110
Destroyed the Artificial Life Form R&D Lab
and was then put to sleep.

09:16.950 --> 09:19.000
Gekka's a mystery jellyfish.

09:19.000 --> 09:20.750
Everyone has a heavy past.

09:20.750 --> 09:22.810
No one here is "normal".

09:23.200 --> 09:28.840
Leaving the final bit with Gekka aside,
it's amazing that you have all that memorized.

09:28.840 --> 09:33.420
I thought you were infatuated with the wedding, but I see, you are indeed a mother.

09:33.420 --> 09:36.490
You indeed are still inept as a father.

09:37.550 --> 09:40.730
When you get caught up in data,
you lose sight of what's in front of you.

09:40.730 --> 09:43.040
When you have Yuuka right in front of you,

09:43.040 --> 09:47.190
not looking at her and being deceived by a piece of paper is what fools do.

09:48.080 --> 09:49.730
Same goes for the wedding cakes!

09:49.730 --> 09:51.430
You understand the value only after you eat them.

09:51.430 --> 09:53.960
So forget that and come have a taste!

09:55.130 --> 10:00.230
I take your twisted character as proof you are carrying something heavy on your shoulders.

10:04.300 --> 10:06.830
Those two's actions have been strange since yesterday.

10:06.830 --> 10:10.710
They must be practicing the song to sing at my wedding!

10:10.710 --> 10:12.820
Remember the Frenzy Sisters?

10:27.490 --> 10:30.960
Judging from the trace, Yuuka should be around here.

10:33.480 --> 10:34.910
Next.

10:34.910 --> 10:37.060
If it hurts, why don't you say it hurts?

10:38.440 --> 10:40.160
Why won't you say anything?

10:40.160 --> 10:42.020
That's what's so annoying about you!

10:42.020 --> 10:42.990
Move!

10:45.490 --> 10:46.620
Come on!

10:46.620 --> 10:47.620
Say!

10:47.620 --> 10:48.630
Something!

10:48.950 --> 10:49.990
Honored Sister!

10:49.990 --> 10:50.930
You can't.

10:50.930 --> 10:52.510
Why are you stopping me?!

10:52.510 --> 10:55.170
Because we'd kill them.

10:58.920 --> 11:02.910
But you're no longer Black Thirteen, are you?

11:02.910 --> 11:05.190
You're not a biological weapon.

11:05.190 --> 11:09.040
You can live as one of the family members.

11:10.850 --> 11:12.870
We're not blood-related.

11:13.260 --> 11:15.360
We've only spent a little time together.

11:15.870 --> 11:19.360
Yet, I want to save Yuuka a lot.

11:19.360 --> 11:20.480
Hyouka...

11:20.840 --> 11:24.740
But if I do, I think Yuuka and everyone will be sad.

11:24.740 --> 11:26.370
Though I'm not exactly sure.

11:30.890 --> 11:32.210
Hey, let's go.

11:33.300 --> 11:34.380
Honored Sister!

11:37.380 --> 11:39.990
Teika-kun. Hyouka. Why are you here?

11:39.990 --> 11:44.620
Teika said you were acting strange, so I put a bug on you.

11:45.160 --> 11:47.350
I regret that I asked for such an action.

11:47.350 --> 11:49.900
S-So you were worried about me.

11:49.900 --> 11:51.700
But I'm fine now.

11:51.700 --> 11:54.850
Please don't talk about this to Dad and Mom-

11:56.360 --> 11:57.940
How could this be...

12:00.850 --> 12:01.930
Father.

12:06.020 --> 12:07.640
Why didn't you tell me about this?!

12:07.640 --> 12:09.840
Please stop! They didn't do anything wrong!

12:09.840 --> 12:11.620
I didn't want you to know!

12:11.620 --> 12:16.710
Since, once I'm home, I can have fun with everyone like nothing happened!

12:16.710 --> 12:18.630
Why would you lie to yourself like that?

12:18.630 --> 12:20.090
I don't care if it's a lie!

12:20.090 --> 12:23.430
All I want is to be able to smile with everyone!

12:25.180 --> 12:28.140
I was happy just to have a place like that...

12:45.750 --> 12:47.750
Can't eat any more.

12:51.490 --> 12:52.450
You mustn't!

12:52.450 --> 12:53.630
Come to your senses!

12:53.630 --> 12:56.040
You're not in any condition to make a rational decision right now, Mother!

12:56.570 --> 13:00.800
Sushi as a wedding cake is just wrong!

13:00.800 --> 13:04.130
I don't want to see any more cakes. Take them away.

13:04.130 --> 13:04.130
Yes.

13:07.310 --> 13:07.840
Oh?

13:11.760 --> 13:14.400
Mother! Yuuka-chan's in trouble!

13:14.400 --> 13:16.310
What are you doing at this crucial moment?!

13:20.510 --> 13:21.500
Yuuka?

13:22.110 --> 13:22.910
Yuuka?

13:28.250 --> 13:29.080
Yuuka?!

13:29.080 --> 13:30.340
We have a problem!

13:30.340 --> 13:33.870
Father, Yuuka-chan left this letter in the fridge.

13:37.480 --> 13:40.390
A world like this can just disappear.

13:40.940 --> 13:43.660
God, do you hate me?

13:44.140 --> 13:45.670
I hate you.

13:46.610 --> 13:51.930
I must be the Child of Enka. The god of destruction's child.

13:52.350 --> 13:56.050
After all, no one else hates this world at all.

13:56.380 --> 13:57.700
I've had enough.

13:57.700 --> 13:58.890
I've had enough already.

13:59.540 --> 14:01.460
Thank you for worrying about me.

14:00.270 --> 14:01.460
Yuuka!

14:01.460 --> 14:05.820
I'm glad I was able to become Midarezaki Yuuka, even if it was for a short period of time.

14:01.460 --> 14:03.290
Yuuka, open the door!

14:04.480 --> 14:05.820
Open the door, Yuuka!

14:05.820 --> 14:08.240
But I guess this is the end.

14:05.820 --> 14:06.740
You're in there, aren't you?!

14:07.920 --> 14:08.840
Yuuka!

14:08.840 --> 14:11.520
I'm sorry. I love you all.

14:11.520 --> 14:12.280
Yuuka?

14:12.280 --> 14:13.930
Yuuka's planning on dying.

14:13.930 --> 14:16.970
"I'm the Child of Enka. I will destroy the world."

14:16.970 --> 14:19.840
After coming to that conclusion,
would that kind girl actually do that?

14:19.840 --> 14:20.820
She wouldn't!

14:21.310 --> 14:22.590
Damn it.

14:21.750 --> 14:22.590
Yuuka!

14:22.590 --> 14:24.590
Stand back, Ouka, Ginka.

14:28.030 --> 14:31.680
It's hard. Ramming it would just break your shoulder.

14:31.680 --> 14:34.640
Hyouka, can you break through the door?

14:34.940 --> 14:36.500
I can. Easily.

14:36.870 --> 14:38.640
But you're in the way, Mother.

14:39.170 --> 14:40.600
Stand back a little.

14:44.320 --> 14:48.960
Using the laser made me use calories, and now I'm hungry.

14:48.960 --> 14:50.880
I'll let you eat all you want later.

14:50.880 --> 14:51.530
Yuuka!

14:55.320 --> 14:56.120
Yuuka...

14:58.360 --> 14:59.360
It's always...

14:59.660 --> 15:02.260
It's always been like this for me.

15:03.430 --> 15:05.420
Why do I get picked on?

15:05.760 --> 15:08.360
Why am I always hated?

15:08.360 --> 15:10.330
I love everyone, but at the same time,

15:10.330 --> 15:11.490
I'm so lonely.

15:11.490 --> 15:15.310
So I hate God. I hate the world.

15:15.310 --> 15:20.130
If I am the Child of Enka, I might really destroy the world.

15:20.490 --> 15:22.660
So I should die...

15:22.970 --> 15:24.430
...but I don't want to!

15:24.430 --> 15:25.440
I can't die!

15:40.330 --> 15:42.700
So this was an SOS from Yuuka-chan.

15:42.700 --> 15:49.060
But, even without you having to put this in a fridge, where it's so noticeable, or having to write a letter,

15:49.510 --> 15:51.470
I'm sure someone would have noticed.

15:52.540 --> 15:56.270
After all, we all love you, Yuuka-chan.

16:00.060 --> 16:01.390
Peace.

16:04.190 --> 16:05.350
Everyone...

16:05.860 --> 16:07.870
This is getting interesting!

16:08.610 --> 16:11.570
To gain territory, a battle is necessary!

16:11.570 --> 16:14.820
Kyoka-sama's Family Frenzy, let the party begin!

16:15.470 --> 16:18.040
I'm getting a really bad feeling about this.

16:18.040 --> 16:19.450
Don't worry, Ouka.

16:20.090 --> 16:23.460
As a most wonderful fact, I, Kyouka-sama, am omniscient and omnipotent!

16:23.890 --> 16:25.960
Fear, weak children!

16:25.960 --> 16:30.510
The more you fear, the more power we gain!

16:30.510 --> 16:31.440
Roar!

16:31.930 --> 16:33.510
Roar!

16:33.510 --> 16:36.580
My obedient slave, Gekka the Jellyfish!

16:36.990 --> 16:40.930
Apply your painful electric shock to those kids!

16:43.940 --> 16:46.200
Good going, Teika and Gekka!

16:46.200 --> 16:48.980
Keep playing the stereotypical monster role!

16:46.610 --> 16:48.980
Kyouka, haven't we done enough?

16:53.080 --> 16:58.320
Take the retribution for bullying my daughter when you didn't even expect reprisal from us!

16:57.450 --> 16:58.320
Kyouka!

16:58.320 --> 17:00.530
Shut up! It's getting to the good part!

17:01.080 --> 17:02.250
But fine, I'll do it.

17:02.250 --> 17:05.020
Yuuka, start the next step of the plan.

17:05.020 --> 17:06.680
Text message, sent!

17:06.680 --> 17:09.040
Must you say it out loud each time?

17:09.040 --> 17:11.020
Skill names are meant to be screamed out!

17:11.020 --> 17:13.700
Yuuka, start the next step of the plan.

17:22.390 --> 17:24.350
I won't...

17:25.400 --> 17:27.370
I won't...

17:28.200 --> 17:32.030
I won't let you eat my friends!

17:33.610 --> 17:35.470
Who are you?

17:35.470 --> 17:36.450
Um...

17:36.450 --> 17:37.980
Mr. Bad Lion.

17:37.980 --> 17:41.790
I won't allow you to hurt my classmates anymore.

17:41.790 --> 17:43.620
Oh, then what do you plan on doing about it?

17:43.620 --> 17:47.720
Stop it. A crybaby like you won't be able to do anything.

17:47.720 --> 17:50.040
I'll protect you all.

17:50.040 --> 17:51.170
Since I'm a...

17:52.340 --> 17:57.510
I'm a combat robot created to fight monsters like you!

18:01.680 --> 18:03.020
Mom.

18:09.270 --> 18:10.860
Everyone stand back.

18:10.860 --> 18:13.020
I'll be fighting now.

18:13.020 --> 18:14.980
Hawww~ That was embarrassing.

18:14.980 --> 18:17.390
Hawww~ That was simply embarrassing.

18:17.390 --> 18:19.000
You were really cute.

18:19.000 --> 18:21.700
I must say the script and effects were amazing.

18:21.700 --> 18:23.830
It was done by none other than
the genius that is Kyouka-sama.

18:23.830 --> 18:27.040
It's perfect. Yay!

18:27.710 --> 18:29.940
So that's your true form?

18:29.940 --> 18:32.080
That's right. Are you simply surprised?

18:35.200 --> 18:36.710
Is that really Yuuka?

18:36.710 --> 18:42.010
This is Midarezaki Yuuka in Battle Mode
to destroy evil with the sword of justice!

18:42.010 --> 18:47.350
This is Midarezaki Yuuka in Battle Mode
to destroy evil with the sword of justice!

18:50.460 --> 18:52.520
She's getting carried away!

18:52.520 --> 18:54.420
How cheeky.

18:54.420 --> 18:57.280
Gekka! Tear her to pieces!

18:54.560 --> 18:55.790
She's not listening at all.

18:57.280 --> 18:58.870
How cheeky.

18:59.190 --> 19:02.160
Gekka! Tear her to pieces!

19:02.160 --> 19:06.040
Mom! Please don't destroy my image any more!

19:06.040 --> 19:07.480
Hold on. Let me have a little more fun.

19:07.480 --> 19:10.540
Midarezaki Yuuka Lightsaber Slash!

19:11.340 --> 19:13.910
Don't shout the skill name!

19:12.090 --> 19:16.050
Midarezaki Yuuka Lightsaber Slash!

19:13.910 --> 19:18.060
Dad!

19:25.020 --> 19:25.890
Welcome back.

19:25.890 --> 19:28.520
To kill Gekka in one move...

19:28.520 --> 19:30.630
I shall retreat for today.

19:30.630 --> 19:31.900
Yuuka was your name, wasn't it?

19:31.900 --> 19:33.030
I shall remember it.

19:33.680 --> 19:36.040
Why are you getting in my way?!

19:36.040 --> 19:42.490
Battle Mode Misarezaki Yuuka's 110 Bloody Show was about to start!

19:41.450 --> 19:42.490
Yes, yes.

19:43.180 --> 19:45.490
Your plan was fabulous.

19:49.000 --> 19:50.470
Now, Yuuka.

19:51.070 --> 19:53.800
From here on, you're really the main character now.

20:00.610 --> 20:01.300
Back.

20:05.130 --> 20:06.800
You're amazing.

20:07.490 --> 20:09.440
You're so strong.

20:09.440 --> 20:11.850
No, I'm not that strong.

20:18.070 --> 20:24.320
Don't need no lukewarm love,

20:24.320 --> 20:30.140
like the foam on top of a hot milk!

20:28.950 --> 20:30.900
Don't need it.

20:30.900 --> 20:37.890
I prefer a painful love like a stab from a knife.

20:37.890 --> 20:47.500
'Cause, after all, they're Family Frenzy's... Papa and Mama!

20:47.500 --> 20:53.260
Congratulations!

20:53.260 --> 20:54.500
You look nice.

20:55.640 --> 21:02.420
So you finally noticed that any dress would end up being overshadowed by Kyouka-sama's beauty?

21:02.420 --> 21:05.770
You're really in love with yourself, aren't you?

21:05.770 --> 21:09.700
How can you love others when you don't love yourself?

21:11.550 --> 21:15.240
This world is fun because you're the main character of your life.

21:20.440 --> 21:22.390
Thank you, everyone.

21:29.050 --> 21:31.010
What a circus they put on!

21:31.010 --> 21:32.630
She thinks she's the heroine.

21:33.520 --> 21:36.450
Let's end this kind game.

21:36.990 --> 21:39.360
Go break Midarezaki Yuuka for me.

21:40.210 --> 21:47.150
Keep oppressing and hurting Midarezaki Yuuka until she yells and goes insane from pain.

21:49.030 --> 21:49.750
Take it!

21:52.200 --> 21:53.700
It's money!

21:54.030 --> 21:58.460
Reiko-chan. You're not allowed to have a fulfilled life.

21:57.910 --> 21:59.630
It's mine.

21:58.460 --> 21:59.630
When I'm...

22:00.460 --> 22:01.530
...at the bottom of the pit, too!

22:20.900 --> 22:24.840
What is a well-trained pig?
That would be those of you watching this today.

22:24.840 --> 22:26.240
Put your hands together and pray to Kyouka-sama!

22:26.240 --> 22:27.840
Do your very best to respect Kyouka-sama!

22:27.840 --> 22:30.160
Praise Kyouka-sama for your life!

22:30.160 --> 22:31.370
As a reward, I shall step on you.

23:40.550 --> 23:41.510
This is Yuuka.

23:41.510 --> 23:49.430
My family is composed of Dad, Mom, a younger brother, another younger brother, and... a younger sister?

23:49.430 --> 23:51.200
My older sister is...

23:51.200 --> 23:53.780
Next time: The Oni Princess of the Himemiya.
